Substantial portions of `crates/phantom-core`, `crates/phantom-database` and
`crates/phantom-macros` are derived from conduwuit, in places verbatim and in
places adapted. The most significant are:

  - the configuration layer, including the example-config generator
    (`phantom-core/src/config/`, `phantom-macros`)
  - the error type and its construction macros (`phantom-core/src/error/`)
  - the logging and debug helpers (`phantom-core/src/log/`,
    `phantom-core/src/debugger.rs`)
  - the allocator integration (`phantom-core/src/alloc/`)
  - assorted shared utilities (`phantom-core/src/result/`, and the
    type-named modules beside it)
  - the database layer (`phantom-database`)

These files have been modified. Changes include renaming to phantom's
namespace, adapting to current upstream releases of ruma and tracing whose APIs
have moved since the versions conduwuit pins, restructuring the module layout,
omitting subsystems phantom has not yet ported, and adding tests. Modifications
are noted in comments at the point where they occur.
